  "content": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" />\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Thin Air 引入嚴酷的空氣機制，隨著你離開世界海平面越高，呼吸越來越困難。無論是探索洞穴還是攀登高山，若未帶上足夠的空氣供應都變得非常危險！甚至不要考慮前往地獄...</span></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" />\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在 Y=0 以下或 Y=128 以上以及地獄中，你會逐漸失去空氣</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">在主世界的末地中完全沒有空氣</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">你可以使用自由呼吸藥水（原為水下呼吸）或呼吸器和氣囊來保護自己</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">使用靈魂火焰、靈魂火把或靈魂營火為自己創造小而溫暖的安全區域，或者使用一瓶靈魂火焰恢復肺部</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">安全燈會在你的物品欄和世界中的顏色變化以提示你周圍的空氣品質。也可以為裝飾上色！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">溺水者會在攻擊時吸走你的空氣</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">此外作為一個有趣的bonus：右鍵點擊火把使其噴出粒子，或許是作為洞穴出口的訊號</span></strong></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" />\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\">PUZZLES LIB</a> (Fabric 與 NeoForge)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\">Fabric API</a> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\">Forge Config API Port</a> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">如果某個模組支援，可以直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行設定（需安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a>，由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\">Prospector</a> 提供，且僅限 Fabric）。請注意，在較舊版本的 Minecraft 中，還需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\">Forge Config Screens</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有檔案位於 <code>.minecraft/config</code> 目錄下，文件名為 <code>MOD_ID-client.toml</code>、<code>MOD_ID-common.toml</code> 或 <code>MOD_ID-server.toml</code>，視配置類型而定。並非每個模組都會存在所有類型的配置文件。</span></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">🌟 感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/petrak_at\">Petra</a> 最初建立此模組，名為 Miner's Lung。Thin Air 只是將原始項目移植到現代版本的 Minecraft。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">🌟 感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/thatguynamedalpha\">AlphaMode</a> 將 Miner's Lung 移植到 Minecraft 1.19.2，為 Thin Air 奠定了基礎。</span></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ender-zoology\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/horse-expert\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />\n<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/thinair/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" />",
